    "title": "Conway Ghost Walk brings local tales to life - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sarah T. Jackson info@myhorrynews.com ,\n8 hours ago CONWAY, S.C. — When the sun goes down and shadows stretch beneath Conway’s historic oak trees, the city’s streets take on a life of their own. For three nights in October, local legends, spooky tales and a little hometown humor bring downtown Conway to life during the 2026 Conway Ghost Walk. Read full article\n3",
